@fg-lab/amadeus-qq README · Install and configure：Install the prebuilt `.tgz` with the official DSH plugin manager into your selected Profile. No local source build is required. Follow [installation instructions](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md); do not copy configuration into a running Profile by hand.

Connect NapCat, choose a Workspace, set the Owner QQ number and authorize individual Scenes. Start with Observe.

The other Amadeus plugins are optional. Install only the integrations you need.

@fg-lab/amadeus-qq README · 安装与首次配置：使用官方 DSH 插件管理器将预构建 `.tgz` 安装到所需 Profile，无需手工构建源码。按[安装说明](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md)操作，不要手工改写正在运行的 Profile。

配置 NapCat、选择工作区、填写管理员 QQ 号并逐项授权场景。建议先选择仅观察。

其他 Amadeus 插件均为可选联动，按需要分别安装。
